          {
            "msg_id": "M19",
            "speaker_id": 36844,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, I've put together a first draft for the standard loading sequence for T2. The main idea is to load heavy to light, back to front, to keep the trailer balanced. I've also added some notes on securing different cargo types. Feedback is welcome.",
