            "speaker_id": 81581,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "This is a solid start, @36844. Very clear. For the visual guide A4, we should definitely include diagrams for this. On the safety side for T3, I think 'Check for floor debris and spills' must be a mandatory step on the checklist A2 before any equipment moves. It's a huge slip hazard.",
